a963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新岁雪霁到西湖作三首 其一","author":"宋庠","text":"新年城曲坐溪台，密霰初收晚冻开。\n无限禽声兼柳意，欲催春色过湖来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48599,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"照虚亭","author":"宋庠","text":"洛渠西北暮烟来，碧瓦朱轩压水开。\n岸曲便容刳木艇，阶唇仍作钓鱼台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48600,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"睡足","author":"宋庠","text":"府廨寥寥似野庐，晏眠犹厌阁铃呼。\n不知云梦泽南日，得似富平津北无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48601,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"僦庐僻远因畜鸣鸡为入谒之候岁久驯狎其信如一因成短咏","author":"宋庠","text":"唳鹤啼乌隔斗城，喈喈辛苦报朝缨。\n僦庐不识端门漏，长愧东窗第一声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48602,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"榴花","author":"宋庠","text":"谁取孤根植槛旁，绛跗丹蘤斗年芳。\n惊飙莫损亭亭艳，百子先秋未有房。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48603,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"漫成","author":"宋庠","text":"二典勋华冠号荣，灿然三代继英声。\n如何孟子尊儒术，不肯临篇信武成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48604,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"漫成二绝 其二","author":"宋庠","text":"代故由来足纠纷，高才忧世强云云。\n太宗不用长沙傅，虚使群臣谥孝文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48605,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"漫成二绝 其一","author":"宋庠","text":"日日开门避宠呼，舞骖飞盖共虚徐。\n昔人枉解痊秦痔，只得君王五乘车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48606,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"碧芦堂","author":"宋庠","text":"寂寂虚堂一自幽，绀梢苍叶更临流。\n不须重画沧浪境，一片江天小样秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48607,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"潜溪晚归二首 其二","author":"宋庠","text":"刹刹寻僧驻盖频，已闻归骑趣城闉。\n岩云不散溪泉咽，野色幽声共怨人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48608,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"潜溪晚归二首 其一","author":"宋庠","text":"诘曲山阿冒石梯，听泉寻竹到招提。\n凭阑未遍催归驭，可惜溪西更有溪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48609,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蔬食","author":"宋庠","text":"退食西轩玩竺坟，鹊炉烟细篆难分。\n劳生未识心斋理，枉学颜徒不茹荤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48610,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题巢父井亭","author":"宋庠","text":"箕岭逃尧去不回，沈沈遗甃碧烟开。\n廉泉让水犹堪贵，何况曾轻天下